    "title": "Urgent Opening Teacher at IIT Madras International Enterprises",
    "description": "IIT Madras International Enterprises, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Teacher for our Navi Mumbai operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout IIT Madras International Enterprises:\nIIT Madras International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Maintain student records and prepare progress reports\n• Utilize technology and digital tools to enhance learning outcomes\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n• Collaborate with faculty on curriculum development initiatives\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Create curriculum-aligned learning materials and assessments\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Curriculum Development\n• Proficiency in Mentoring\n• Proficiency in Child Psychology\n• Proficiency in Educational Technology\n• Proficiency in E-learning\n• Proficiency in Lesson Planning\n• Proficiency in Communication Skills\n• Proficiency in Classroom Management\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Flexible working hours\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with IIT Madras International Enterprises!",
